[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 421.83, "timestamp": "00:07:01", "text": "我当时就觉得“是”。谢天谢地你这么做了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 423.749, "timestamp": "00:07:03", "text": "我刚才说的就是我一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 425.83, "timestamp": "00:07:05", "text": "嗯，被凯撞了。碾过我的脚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 428.15, "timestamp": "00:07:08", "text": "之前，嗯，它像好几个一样压碎了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 430.07, "timestamp": "00:07:10", "text": "我脚上的骨头都疼，还打了石膏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 432.309, "timestamp": "00:07:12", "text": "持续了好几个月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 434.95, "timestamp": "00:07:14", "text": "我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 437.589, "timestamp": "00:07:17", "text": "我被打过一次，但不知怎么的，我竟然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 440.55, "timestamp": "00:07:20", "text": "没有弄坏任何东西。我猜当它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 443.27, "timestamp": "00:07:23", "text": "这对我的影响很大，感觉我的身体就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 446.07, "timestamp": "00:07:26", "text": "那该怎么称呼它呢？放松的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 447.67, "timestamp": "00:07:27", "text": "被击中了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 448.79, "timestamp": "00:07:28", "text": "猫骨头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 451.189, "timestamp": "00:07:31", "text": "是的。我当时身体一点也不紧张。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 452.87, "timestamp": "00:07:32", "text": "我被打了，因为我想我当时是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 455.27, "timestamp": "00:07:35", "text": "被击中时我出现了意识分离，而且我只……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 457.909, "timestamp": "00:07:37", "text": "事后我才意识到自己被打了，那时我已经……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 459.67, "timestamp": "00:07:39", "text": "被撞了，我当时就在旁边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 461.51, "timestamp": "00:07:41", "text": "道路"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 463.43, "timestamp": "00:07:43", "text": "因为我的身体没有紧张，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 465.11, "timestamp": "00:07:45", "text": "就是那件事。显然这就是原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 467.029, "timestamp": "00:07:47", "text": "我居然没断一根骨头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 469.51, "timestamp": "00:07:49", "text": "虽然有点疼，但我没摔坏什么东西。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 471.35, "timestamp": "00:07:51", "text": "当时并没有紧张。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 474.07, "timestamp": "00:07:54", "text": "所以下次如果你即将被击中时……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 475.99, "timestamp": "00:07:55", "text": "千万别他妈的想这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 477.749, "timestamp": "00:07:57", "text": "就让自己脱离现实。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 479.749, "timestamp": "00:07:59", "text": "确切地。它真的管用。"}]